{"last_link_id": 42, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#263238", "widgets_values": ["# 展陈空间白膜/线稿转商业效果图\n\n1. **结构输入**：上传白膜、SU 截图、线稿或低清效果图。\n2. **风格输入**：上传一张最接近目标的参考图，建议为无大字、无人物特写的完整空间。\n3. 修改 **Positive Prompt** 中的展厅类型、材料、色彩与主题。\n4. 先运行一次，检查 Depth/Lineart 预览是否干净。\n5. 检查一阶段效果图，确认结构后再等待 1.5x 低重绘精修。\n\n## 核心逻辑\n`Load Structure -> 1.50MP -> Depth ControlNet + Scribble ControlNet`\n\n`Load Style -> CLIP Vision Prep -> IP-Adapter Style`\n\n`Structure VAE Encode -> Base Render -> 1.5x -> Low-denoise Refine -> Save`\n\n## 默认输出\n输入长宽比不变；1536x1024 输入保持为约 1.50MP，精修后约 2304x1536。\n\n> 注意：生成图只用于空间、材料与灯光底图。真实展项、地图、文字、标识和施工尺寸必须在 PS/AI/ID 中替换与复核。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用顺序", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#111820", "size": [620, 760], "pos": [-760, -80], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2, 3, 21], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [310, 150], "pos": [390, 110], "widgets_values": ["lanczos", 1.5, 64], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 1, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "像素数量"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution_steps"}, "name": "resolution_steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution_steps"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "widget_ue_connectable": {"megapixels": true, "resolution_steps": true, "upscale_method": true}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [4, 41], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [360, 150], "pos": [770, -40], "widgets_values": ["depth_anything_v2_vitl.pth", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 2, "label": "