 ["6a8cb5a760c1959cddc6dbb3d1a436337ed28acc1fd9103b7338c0df925c8346.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONTROL_NET", "links": [20], "label": "ControlNet", "type": "CONTROL_NET", "localized_name": "ControlNet"}], "size": [484.14727783203125, 115.63810729980469], "pos": [2965.852783203125, 234.3618927001953], "widgets_values": ["controlnet-scribble-sdxl-1.0-xinsir.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "control_net_name"}, "name": "control_net_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ControlNet名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "ControlNetLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "widget_ue_connectable": {"control_net_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "ControlNetLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONTROL_NET", "links": [16], "label": "ControlNet", "type": "CONTROL_NET", "localized_name": "ControlNet"}], "size": [440, 90], "pos": [2600, -20], "widgets_values": ["controlnet-depth-sdxl-1.0-xinsir.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "control_net_name"}, "name": "control_net_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ControlNet名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "ControlNetLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "widget_ue_connectable": {"control_net_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "ControlNetLoader"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [9], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [12, 13], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}, {"name": "VAE", "links": [14, 24, 27, 32], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [386.1665954589844, 125.04579162597656], "pos": [1656.0750732421875, -35.04579162597656], "widgets_values": ["ARC空间设计师XL _ 室内建筑景观Design大模型_ARC_0.4 .safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "ckpt_name"}, "name": "ckpt_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "Checkpoint名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "CheckpointLoaderSimple", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "widget_ue_connectable": {"ckpt_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CheckpointLoaderSimple"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#4d3b20", "widgets_values": ["# 参数调整（Depth + Scribble 专用模型）\n\n| 输入 | Depth strength | Scribble strength | 一阶段 denoise | IP-Adapter |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| **当前地球展厅白膜** | 0.80 | 0.42 | 0.78 | 0.40 |\n| **普通 SU 白膜/灰模** | 0.75-0.82 | 0.45-0.55 | 0.78-0.84 | 0.40-0.55 |\n| **干净线稿** | 0.20-0.35 | 0.72-0.85 | 0.88-0.94 | 0.35-0.50 |\n| **低清效果图优化** | 0.60-0.72 | 0.35-0.48 | 0.52-0.68 | 0.30-0.45 |\n\n## 调参判断\n- 结构跑偏：一阶段 denoise 降低 0.05，Depth 提高 0.05。\n- 墙线/开口变形：Scribble 提高 0.05，但密集格栅顶不建议超过 0.55。\n- 顶棚网格过强：LineArt coarse 保持 enable，分辨率降至 640，Scribble 降至 0.35。\n- 白膜感残留：一阶段 denoise 提高 0.05，不要先降 ControlNet。\n- 参考图抢构图/带入文字：IP-Adapter 降到 0.30-0.35，保持 `style transfer`。\n- 材质塑料感：增强 roughness、接缝、收口与真实尺度描述，二阶段 denoise 不超过 0.30。\n\n## 验收顺序\n1. 相机视点和透视消失点不变。\n2. 墙体、柱、吊顶、地面和展项轮廓不增删。\n3. 展台与岩石不漂浮，各构件有物理支撑。\n4. 材料粗糙度、反射、灯光方向统一。\n5. 无伪文字、无水印、无随机标识。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "不同输入类型的参数调整", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#18140d", "size": [660, 800], "pos": [2600, 760], "id": 29, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#20364d", "widgets_values": ["# 必需自定义节点\n\n1. `comfyui_controlnet_aux`\n   - `DepthAnythingV2Preprocessor`\n   - `LineArtPreprocessor`\n2. `ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus`\n   - `PrepImageForClipVision`\n   - `IPAdapterUnifiedLoader`\n   - `IPAdapterAdvanced`\n\n其余为 ComfyUI Core 节点。本版已完全删除 Union/ProMax 和 `SetUnionControlNetType`。\n\n# 模型文件\n\n## checkpoints\n- `sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors`\n- 位置：`ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/`\n\n## controlnet（平台现有模型）\n- `controlnet-depth-sdxl-1.0.safetensors`\n- `controlnet-scribble-sdxl-1.0.safetensors`\n- 位置：`ComfyUI/models/controlnet/`\n\n## ipadapter\n- `ip-adapter-plus_sdxl_vit-h.safetensors`\n- 位置：`ComfyUI/models/ipadapter/`\n\n## clip_vision\n- `CLIP-ViT-H-14-laion2B-s32B-b79K.safetensors`\n- 位置：`ComfyUI/models/clip_vision/`\n\n## annotators\n- `depth_anything_v2_vitl.pth`\n- Lineart 预处理模型由 `comfyui_controlnet_aux` 首次运行时调用。\n\n# 兼容边界\n- 导入后红节点：先用 Manager -> Install Missing Custom Nodes。\n- 模型下拉框空白：在两个 ControlNet Loader 中改选平台实际文件名。\n- 不要用 SD1.5 ControlNet 连接 SDXL checkpoint。\n- 如云平台禁止自定义节点，将 Depth/Lineart 改为平台预处理后的图片输入，主生成部分不变。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "云平台节点与模型清单", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#0d141c", "size": [800, 800], "pos": [3320, 760], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [22, 30], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [390, 310], "pos": [2110, 130], "widgets_values": [0.6500000000000001, "style transfer", "average", 0, 0.8200000000000002, "V only"], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 10, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "ipadapter", "link": 11, "label": "IPAdapter", "type": "IPADAPTER", "localized_name": "ipadapter"}, {"name": "image", "link": 7, "label": "正面图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image_negative", "label": "负面图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_negative"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "attn_mask", "label": "关注层遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "attn_mask"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "clip_vision", "label": "CLIP视觉", "type": "CLIP_VISION", "localized_name": "clip_vision"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight"}, "name": "weight", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "权重"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_type"}, "name": "weight_type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "权重类型"}, {"widget": {"